---
import BaseLayout from '../components/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | TypeInsight"
  description="TypeInsight privacy policy — how we collect, use, and protect your information."
>
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 font-sans text-charcoal">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-xs text-muted mb-10">Last updated: August 2025</p>

    <section class="space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl text-charcoal mb-3">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>TypeInsight does not require account creation. We do not collect your name, email address, or any personally identifying information.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">We use Google Analytics and Google AdSense, which may collect anonymised usage data and set cookies on your device. We do not store your test answers on our servers — all quiz processing happens in your browser.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl text-charcoal mb-3">2. Cookies</h2>
        <p>Google AdSense and Google Analytics use cookies to serve relevant ads and measure traffic. You can opt out of personalised advertising through Google's Ads Settings at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" class="underline hover:text-charcoal" target="_blank" rel="noopener">adssettings.google.com</a>.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl text-charcoal mb-3">3. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>We participate in the BetterHelp affiliate programme. If you click an affiliate link and make a purchase, we may earn a commission. BetterHelp's own privacy policy governs any data you provide to them.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl text-charcoal mb-3">4. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>If you are in the European Economic Area or California, you have rights regarding your personal data under GDPR and CCPA respectively. Because we collect minimal data, in practice the most relevant right is opting out of interest-based advertising via the links above.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl text-charcoal mb-3">5. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this policy. Material changes will be reflected in the "Last updated" date above. Continued use of TypeInsight after a policy change constitutes acceptance.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl text-charcoal mb-3">6. Contact</h2>
        <p>For privacy-related questions, please use the contact form on our homepage.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
